# R43 · NEW: admins are told ONCE when the treasury crosses below this (hysteresis in redis) and once on recovery; ABOVE the 20 % genesis floor so the warning precedes deferred grants. 0 = disabled = today
#   read at: background_tasks/treasury_low_watch.py::_threshold   code default: 0
#   env:agentvault_registry_a
